# Portfolio README

- Write project sections in **English** (audience: recruiters and collaborators).
- Each AI Engineering project needs: cover image, linked repo, architecture table, benchmark/results when available.
- Use badges for stack (Python, LangChain, Ollama, ChromaDB, RAGAS, LangSmith, PyTorch, etc.).
- Structure: Description → Architecture → Results/Metrics → Demo media → link back to top.
- External project repos: link to the canonical GitHub URL, not duplicate code here.
- Images live under `images/<project-slug>/`; use descriptive alt text and consistent widths (1000×350 covers).
- When adding a new project (e.g. email agent), follow the same section pattern as LLM-Eval-Suite and Document RAG Agent.
